<title>SWEDEN: Sydkraft in 2.2 bln SKR capital gain from.</title>
<headline>Sydkraft in 2.2 bln SKR capital gain from.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish power group Sydkraft AB said on Friday it would get a total capital gain of 2.2 billion crowns from selling part of its stake in Germany's VEBA.</p>
<p>Sydkraft said in a statement it reduced its stake in VEBA this year to around one percent from 3.2 percent.</p>
</text>
